<title>NETHERLANDS: Gist shares tumble after profits warning.</title>
<headline>Gist shares tumble after profits warning.</headline>
<dateline>AMSTERDAM 1997-08-05</dateline>
<text>
<p>Dutch biochemicals and food group Gist-Brocades NV shares fell by around 15 percent after the company said its 1997 profits would be below those of 1996.</p>
<p>The shares fell to a low of 66.10 guilders soon after the opening, 12.70 guilders below Monday's closing level.</p>
<p>Gist said the price of penicillin had hit an &quot;historic low&quot; due to additional capacity mainly in China and India.</p>
<p>-- Amsterdam newsroom +31 20 504 5000, Fax +31 20 504 5040</p>
